<title>ITALY: Italy's President meets Prodi but no details given.</title>
<headline>Italy's President meets Prodi but no details given.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro met Prime Minister Romano Prodi for talks on Wednesday, Scalfaro's office said in a statement. It gave no details.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2505</p>
